  "source_commit_scope": "source_commit 98e1b39893d5a5607db79c29415441da092d6e67 is unchanged from 2.6.0 and covers the private-derived files only. The 2.6.1 housekeeping files (self-test export, binary-regression.test.js, self-test-export.test.js) come from private branch release/2.6.1-housekeeping at 80965ad040b331a50daba8f0c049d3e952f34ec7, which is not merged to private main at the time of writing. The private monorepo contains no hookInstaller or wasm output, so no private commit contains the public_origin_files; do not read source_commit as covering them.",
