    "note": "These files were authored directly in this public repository (Agy, 0778caf) and have no source in the private monorepo main. hookInstaller.ts and artifact-cli.ts were then modified in 2.6.1 (installer hardening and QA fixes F1/F2, approved by Marc 2026-10-24); the two hookInstaller test files were written in 2.6.1. The wasm/ files are the build output described in wasm_provenance; mgc_wasm.js was replaced in 2.6.1 by the pristine generated file. packages/provenance-ts/package.json and the two READMEs are public-curated variants.",
